.\" SPDX-License-Identifier: BSD-2-Clause
.Dd July 31, 2026
.Dt LIBREBOOTCTL 3
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm rebootctl_client_open ,
.Nm rebootctl_reboot ,
.Nm rebootctl_shutdown ,
.Nm rebootctl_cancel ,
.Nm rebootctl_status ,
.Nm rebootctl_notification_decode ,
.Nm rebootctl_client_close
.Nd typed client API for the supervised reboot service
.Sh LIBRARY
.Li librebootctl
.Pq Fl lrebootctl
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.In rebootctl.h
.Ft int
.Fn rebootctl_client_open "struct rebootctl_client **client"
.Ft void
.Fn rebootctl_client_close "struct rebootctl_client *client"
.Ft int
.Fn rebootctl_reboot "struct rebootctl_client *client" "uint32_t howto"
.Ft int
.Fn rebootctl_shutdown "struct rebootctl_client *client"
.Ft int
.Fn rebootctl_reboot_after "struct rebootctl_client *client" "uint32_t howto" "uint32_t delay_ms"
.Ft int
.Fn rebootctl_shutdown_after "struct rebootctl_client *client" "uint32_t delay_ms"
.Ft int
.Fn rebootctl_cancel "struct rebootctl_client *client"
.Ft int
.Fn rebootctl_status "struct rebootctl_client *client" "bool *pending"
.Ft int
.Fn rebootctl_status_detailed "struct rebootctl_client *client" "struct rebootctl_status_reply *status"
.Ft int
.Fn rebootctl_notification_decode "const char *topic" "const void *payload" "size_t length" "struct rebootctl_notification *notification"
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The library discovers
.Dq org.5bsd.system.reboot
through
.Xr libservice 3 ,
owns an independent direct session, validates every reply, and hides the
service name and wire protocol from applications.
Mutating operations remain subject to the provider's authenticated
service-label policy.
The default reboot and shutdown helpers request a ten-second delay.
.Pp
.Fn rebootctl_notification_decode
strictly validates a shutdown notification received through
.Xr libnotifycmp 3 ,
including its topic/state pairing, exact payload size, version, timestamps,
flags, error value, and requester label, before copying it to
.Fa notification .
.Pp
.Fn rebootctl_cancel
cancels the single pending operation and fails with
.Er ENOENT
when no operation is pending.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr libservice 3 ,
.Xr rebootd 8
